00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:52.800
Scream is iconic because of its ability&nbsp;
to use classic slasher movies as the basis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:55.680
for the tropes that it satirizes.&nbsp;
Drew Barrymore, who plays Casey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:59.680
was the biggest name talent on the film. The&nbsp;
movie poster is literally just her face, yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:03.040
she’s barely in the movie. This makes&nbsp;
her early death much more shocking.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:06.160
It’s basically the same trick&nbsp;
